gina Coeli Hall</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-783 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-35572"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/special-features/">Special Features</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-100 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-35623"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/sacraments/">Sacraments</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-2150 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-36712"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/news/">News &#038; Announcements</a></li></ul></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-36617 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-36622"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/cathedral-shop/">Gift Shop</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-282 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-36717"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/give/">Giving</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-91295 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-113067"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/sunday-offertory-collection/">Sunday Offertory Collection</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-91337 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-113125"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/all-good-gifts/">All Good Gifts</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-36627 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-36632"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/new-homepage-design/new-design-endowment-fund-for-the-preservation-of-the-cathedral-basilica/">Preservation Society Endowment Fund</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-63274 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-113068"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/legacy-of-faith-capital-campaign/">Legacy of Faith Campaign</a></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-5067 menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-37700"><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/the-boland-schreck-fund-for-liturgical-music/">Boland-Schreck Music Fund</a></li></ul></li><li class="et_pb_menu_page_id-38709 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-38709"><a href="mailto:weddings@savannahcathedral.org">Weddings</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class="et_mobile_nav_menu"><div class="mobile_nav closed"> <span class="mobile_menu_bar"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><div id="et-main-area"><div id="main-content"><article id="post-48" class="post-48 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry pmpro-has-access"><div class="entry-content"><div class="et-l et-l--post"><div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters3"><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_0 et_pb_section_parallax et_pb_with_background et_pb_fullwidth_section et_section_regular" > <span class="et_parallax_bg_wrap"><span
 class="et_parallax_bg"
 style="background-image: url(https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/doctor-15.jpg);"
 ></span></span><section class="et_pb_module et_pb_fullwidth_header et_pb_fullwidth_header_0 et_animated et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_dark"><div class="et_pb_fullwidth_header_container center"><div class="header-content-container center"><div class="header-content"><h3 class="et_pb_module_header">Visiting and Touring the Cathedral Basilica</h3><div class="et_pb_header_content_wrapper"></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_fullwidth_header_overlay"></div><div class="et_pb_fullwidth_header_scroll"></div></section></div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_1 et_pb_specialty_fullwidth et_pb_with_background et_section_specialty" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_gutters1"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_3 et_pb_column_0   et_pb_specialty_column  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_row_inner et_pb_row_inner_0"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_0"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon">9</span></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Weekday/Saturday Touring Hours</span></h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>9 AM &#8211; 11:30 AM</p><p>1 PM &#8211; 4:30 PM</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_1 et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon">9</span></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Sunday Touring Hours</span></h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>1:00PM &#8211; 4:30PM</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_inner et_pb_row_inner_1"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_2 et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0 et_hover_enabled  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h4 style="text-align: center;"><strong>The Cathedral Basilica is an active Catholic Church.</strong></h4><h4 style="text-align: center;">Please be respectful. We are closed for touring during funerals, weddings, and other religious events.</h4><h4 style="text-align: center;">Please check our website calendar for potential closings during normal business hours.</h4><h4 style="text-align: center;"><strong>We are closed for touring on Thanksgiving Day November 26th </strong></h4><h4>All tour guides and docents in the church are volunteers, and we do our best to make you feel welcome.</h4><h4>No tickets are required to visit or tour the Cathedral. We do not sell tickets.</h4><h4>We do not allow scavenger hunts in the Cathedral Basilica.</h4><h4>No professional videography or photo shoots are allowed in the Cathedral Basilica without advance permission.</h4><p><span style="font-size: 18px; color: #0000ff;"><span style="color: #000000;">For our visitor, school, and tour policies, click<strong> <a style="color: #0000ff;" href="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/touring-guidelines-5.pdf" rel="attachment wp-att-63098">here</a>. </strong></span></span><span style="color: #333333; font-size: 18px;">Please check our </span><a style="font-size: 18px;" href="https://savannahcathedral.org/monthly-calendar/"><span style="color: #0000ff;"><strong>calendar </strong></span></a><span style="color: #333333; font-size: 18px;">for</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: #0000ff;"><span style="color: #000000;"> schedule changes and closings or scan the QR code below to view it. We have a docent available anytime we are open. The docent can give a tour, answer questions, and direct you to some of the special features of our Cathedral Basilica.</span></span></p><p><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/adobe-express-qr-code.png"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-64855 aligncenter " src="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/adobe-express-qr-code.png" alt="" width="230" height="230" /></a></p><h4> </h4><h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Guided Tours and School Classes</strong></h3><h4>Typically, we have docents available to give tours of the Cathedral Basilica (9 AM &#8211; 11:30 AM and 1 PM- 4:30 PM). <strong>However, there will be <em>no guided tours or classes by anyone before 10 AM each weekday unless you have the tour coordinator&#8217;s advance permission. </em></strong></h4><h4>If you plan to bring any group (students, classes, adults) into the Cathedral, we require advance notice whether you want us to provide a docent or not. Email &#8211; <a href="mailto:cathedralbasilicatour@gmail.com">cathedralbasilicatour@gmail.com</a></h4><h4><strong>Tour companies, schools, or individuals can give tours or hold classes in the Cathedral WITH advance permission from the tour coordinator. </strong></h4><h4>To guarantee a docent is available for a guided tour, <strong>groups of 10 or more, please email <a href="mailto:cathedralbasilicatour@gmail.com">cathedralbasilicatour@gmail.com</a></strong></h4><h4>Touring hours are 9 AM-11:30 AM and 1 PM &#8211; 4:30 PM. Typically, docents are available Monday through Friday during open hours. On weekends, we have limited docent availability.</h4><h4>The Cathedral Basilica is handicap accessible. There is an elevator on Harris Street.</h4><h4>A small donation of $3.00 per adult is appreciated.</h4><h4>To schedule a tour, email: <a href="mailto:cathedralbasilicatour@gmail.com">cathedralbasilicatour@gmail.com</a></h4></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_inner et_pb_row_inner_2 et_pb_gutters2"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_3"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><span class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon"></span></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Parking</span></h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>We do not have a designated parking lot.  Street Parking Available.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_4 et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_3  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="128" height="128" src="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/mask.png" alt="" srcset="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/mask.png 128w, https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/mask-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px" class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-36322" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Masks</span></h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>You may wear a mask in the Cathedral Basilica if you choose. It is not mandatory.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_inner et_pb_row_inner_3 et_pb_gutters2"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_5 et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_4  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="128" height="128" src="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/no-pets.png" alt="" srcset="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/no-pets.png 128w, https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/no-pets-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px" class="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-36323" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Pets</span></h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Dogs or other animals, reptiles, birds, pigs, etc.  are not allowed in the Cathedral Basilica with the exception of Service Dogs</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_1    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img decoding="async" width="1080" height="1350" src="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/0_FB_IMG_1638483822390.jpg" alt="" title="" srcset="https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/0_FB_IMG_1638483822390.jpg 1080w, https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/0_FB_IMG_1638483822390-980x1225.jpg 980w, https://savannahcathedral.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/0_FB_IMG_1638483822390-480x600.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1080px, 100vw" class="wp-image-28571" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_hover_enabled  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h4>Daily Readings</h4></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_cta_0 et_pb_promo  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_dark"><div class="et_pb_promo_description"><h2 class="et_pb_module_header">Inspiration for Faith and Devotion</h2></div><div class="et_pb_button_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button et_pb_promo_button" href="https://savannahcathedral.org/daily-readings/">Current Reading</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_0"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child et_pb_column_empty"></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap "></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div><footer class="et-l et-l--footer"><div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters3"><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_0_tb_footer et_animated et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_0_tb_footer"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_0_tb_footer  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0_tb_footer  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_dark"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h4>About Us</h4><p><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/join/">Join the Parish</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/church-history/">Church History</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/cathedral-basilica/">Cathedral Basilica</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/staff/">Staff Directory</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/news/">News</a></p></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_1_tb_footer  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1_tb_footer  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_dark"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h4>Get Involved</h4><p><a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/give/">Give</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/parish-ministries/">Volunteer</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/visit/">Visit</a><br /> <a href="https://savannahcathedral.org/contact/">Contact Us</a></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_2_tb_footer  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2_tb_footer et_hover_enabled  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h4>Get In Touch</h4></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_cta_0_tb_footer et_pb_promo  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_dark"><div class="et_pb_promo_description"><h2 class="et_pb_module_header">Welcome to the Cathedral Basilica of St. John the Baptist. Click the button below to reach us.</h2></div><div class="et_pb_button_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button et_pb_promo_button" href="https://savannahcathedral.org/contact/">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_1_tb_footer et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1_tb_footer"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_3_tb_footer  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3_tb_footer  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner">@2023 Cathedral Basilica of St. John the Baptist. Savannah Web Design &#8211; United Web Works</div></div></div></div></div></div></footer></div></div></div> <script type="speculationrules">{"prefetch":[{"source":"document","where":{"and":[{"href_matches":"/*"},{"not":{"href_matches":["/wp-*.php","/wp-admin/*","/wp-content/uploads/*","/wp-content/*","/wp-content/plugins/*","/wp-content/themes/Divi-child/*","/wp